  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "S1 has strong reporting timelines and broad scope, but omits an explicit during-investigation clause. S2 sets a 55 °C test and 5% review threshold but does not stop sales above 5%, weakening it. S3 requires new-unit shut-off at 24 months and retrofit within 6 years. S4 requires built-in suppression at 36 months. S5 mandates recall at 8/100k with a proportionate corrective remedy and prompt notices, but lacks a serious-injury clause."
 },
